<p>Last updated October 25, 2026.</p>
<p>{{ site.name }} is operated by {{ site.operator }}, a Florida limited liability company. This policy describes what the site collects.</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>We do not require accounts and do not sell personal information. If you use the contact form, we receive the name, email address and message you submit so we can reply. The form is processed by FormSubmit, which forwards it to us by email.</p>
<h2>Analytics</h2>
<p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which measures page views without cookies and without tracking you across sites. Our host, GitHub Pages, may log IP addresses for security and operations.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>We may show advertising in the future, including Google AdSense. If we do, ad partners may use cookies to serve and measure ads, and this page will be updated before ads appear. You can manage personalized Google ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>You can ask us to delete messages you sent through the contact form. Depending on where you live, laws such as the GDPR or state privacy laws may give you further rights. The site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update this policy by posting a new version on this page. Questions go through our <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact form</a>.</p>
